sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant SDK
    participant Cache
    participant GrowthBook
    
    User->>Frontend: Відкриває сторінку
    Frontend->>SDK: Initialize SDK
    SDK->>Cache: Check cache
    
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>SDK: Return features
    else Cache miss
        SDK->>GrowthBook: Fetch features
        GrowthBook-->>SDK: Features config
        SDK->>Cache: Update cache
    end
    
    SDK-->>Frontend: Features ready
    Frontend->>SDK: Check feature("new-ui")
    SDK-->>Frontend: true/false
    Frontend->>User: Render appropriate UI